T(n, k) := if k = 0 then 1 else binomial(2*n - 1, 2*k - 1)$
tabl(nn) := for n:0 thru nn do print(makelist(T(n, k), k, 0, n))$ /* _Franck Maminirina Ramaharo_, Oct 10 2018 */
